      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>other</code> - the reference media type with which to compare",
      "translation": "<code>other</code> - 用于比较的参考媒体类型",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mediaTypes</code> - the string to parse",
      "translation": "<code>mediaTypes</code> - 要解析的字符串",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "the result of the comparison",
      "translation": "比较的结果",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "the list of media types",
      "translation": "媒体类型列表",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "For instance, <code>text/*</code> includes <code>text/plain</code> and <code>text/html</code>,\nand <code>application/*+xml</code> includes <code>application/soap+xml</code>, etc.\nThis method is <b>not</b> symmetric.",
      "translation": "例如，`text/*` 包含 `text/plain` 和 `text/html`，而 `application/*+xml` 包含 `application/soap+xml` 等。此方法<b>不</b>对称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "For instance, <code>text/*</code> is compatible with <code>text/plain</code>,\n<code>text/html</code>, and vice versa. In effect, this method is similar to\n<a href=\"#includes(org.springframework.http.MediaType)\"><code>includes(MediaType)</code></a>, except that it <b>is</b> symmetric.",
      "translation": "例如，`text/*` 与 `text/plain`、`text/html` 兼容，反之亦然。实际上，此方法与<a href=\"#includes(org.springframework.http.MediaType)\"><code>includes(MediaType)</code></a>类似，但它是对称的。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Simply calls <a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#includes(org.springframework.util.MimeType)\"><code>MimeType.includes(MimeType)</code></a> but declared with a\n<code>MediaType</code> parameter for binary backwards compatibility.",
      "translation": "直接调用<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#includes(org.springframework.util.MimeType)\"><code>MimeType.includes(MimeType)</code></a>，但声明为使用<code>MediaType</code>参数，以提供二进制向后兼容性。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Simply calls <a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isCompatibleWith(org.springframework.util.MimeType)\"><code>MimeType.isCompatibleWith(MimeType)</code></a> but declared with a\n<code>MediaType</code> parameter for binary backwards compatibility.",
      "translation": "直接调用<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isCompatibleWith(org.springframework.util.MimeType)\"><code>MimeType.isCompatibleWith(MimeType)</code></a>，但声明为使用<code>MediaType</code>参数，以提供二进制向后兼容性。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This class is meant to reference media types supported by Spring Framework.\nIf your application or library relies on other media types defined in RFCs,\nplease use <a href=\"#parseMediaType(java.lang.String)\"><code>parseMediaType(String)</code></a> or a custom utility class.",
      "translation": "该类旨在引用 Spring Framework 支持的媒体类型。如果您的应用程序或库依赖于 RFC 中定义的其他媒体类型，请使用<a href=\"#parseMediaType(java.lang.String)\"><code>parseMediaType(String)</code></a>或自定义工具类。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This method can be used to for an <code>Accept</code> or <code>Content-Type</code> header.",
      "translation": "此方法可用于<code>Accept</code>或<code>Content-Type</code>标头。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#getSubtype()\">subtype</a> is set to \"*\", parameters empty.",
      "translation": "<code>subtype</code> 被设置为 \"*\"，参数为空。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The parameters are empty.",
      "translation": "参数为空。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Indicates whether this <code>MediaType</code> more specific than the given type.\n<ol>\n<li>if this media type has a <a href=\"#getQualityValue()\">quality factor</a> higher than the other,\nthen this method returns <code>true</code>.</li>\n<li>if this media type has a <a href=\"#getQualityValue()\">quality factor</a> lower than the other,\nthen this method returns <code>false</code>.</li>\n<li>if this mime type has a <a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">wildcard type</a>,\nand the other does not, then this method returns <code>false</code>.</li>\n<li>if this mime type does not have a <a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">wildcard type</a>,\nand the other does, then this method returns <code>true</code>.</li>\n<li>if this mime type has a <a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">wildcard type</a>,\nand the other does not, then this method returns <code>false</code>.</li>\n<li>if this mime type does not have a <a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">wildcard type</a>,\nand the other does, then this method returns <code>true</code>.</li>\n<li>if the two mime types have identical <a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#getType()\">type</a> and\n<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#getSubtype()\">subtype</a>, then the mime type with the most\nparameters is more specific than the other.</li>\n<li>Otherwise, this method returns <code>false</code>.</li>\n</ol>",
      "translation": "指示此 `<code>MediaType</code>` 是否比给定类型更具体。\n<ol>\n<li>如果此媒体类型的<a href=\"#getQualityValue()\">质量因子</a>高于其他类型，则此方法返回 <code>true</code>。</li>\n<li>如果此媒体类型的<a href=\"#getQualityValue()\">质量因子</a>低于其他类型，则此方法返回 <code>false</code>。</li>\n<li>如果此 MIME 类型是<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">通配符类型</a>，而其他类型不是，则此方法返回 <code>false</code>。</li>\n<li>如果此 MIME 类型不是<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">通配符类型</a>，而其他类型是，则此方法返回 <code>true</code>。</li>\n<li>如果此 MIME 类型是<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">通配符类型</a>，而其他类型不是，则此方法返回 <code>false</code>。</li>\n<li>如果此 MIME 类型不是<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">通配符类型</a>，而其他类型是，则此方法返回 <code>true</code>。</li>\n<li>如果两个 MIME 类型的<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#getType()\">类型</a>和<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#getSubtype()\">子类型</a>相同，则参数最多的 MIME 类型比其他类型更具体。</li>\n<li>否则，此方法返回 <code>false</code>。</li>\n</ol>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Indicates whether this <code>MediaType</code> more specific than the given type.\n<ol>\n<li>if this media type has a <a href=\"#getQualityValue()\">quality factor</a> higher than the other,\nthen this method returns <code>false</code>.</li>\n<li>if this media type has a <a href=\"#getQualityValue()\">quality factor</a> lower than the other,\nthen this method returns <code>true</code>.</li>\n<li>if this mime type has a <a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">wildcard type</a>,\nand the other does not, then this method returns <code>true</code>.</li>\n<li>if this mime type does not have a <a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">wildcard type</a>,\nand the other does, then this method returns <code>false</code>.</li>\n<li>if this mime type has a <a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">wildcard type</a>,\nand the other does not, then this method returns <code>true</code>.</li>\n<li>if this mime type does not have a <a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">wildcard type</a>,\nand the other does, then this method returns <code>false</code>.</li>\n<li>if the two mime types have identical <a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#getType()\">type</a> and\n<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#getSubtype()\">subtype</a>, then the mime type with the least\nparameters is less specific than the other.</li>\n<li>Otherwise, this method returns <code>false</code>.</li>\n</ol>",
      "translation": "指示此 `<code>MediaType` 是否比给定类型更具体。\n<ol>\n<li>如果此媒体类型的<a href=\"#getQualityValue()\">质量因子</a>高于其他类型，则此方法返回 <code>false</code>。</li>\n<li>如果此媒体类型的<a href=\"#getQualityValue()\">质量因子</a>低于其他类型，则此方法返回 <code>true</code>。</li>\n<li>如果此 MIME 类型是<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">通配符类型</a>，而其他类型不是，则此方法返回 <code>true</code>。</li>\n<li>如果此 MIME 类型不是<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">通配符类型</a>，而其他类型是，则此方法返回 <code>false</code>。</li>\n<li>如果此 MIME 类型是<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">通配符类型</a>，而其他类型不是，则此方法返回 <code>true</code>。</li>\n<li>如果此 MIME 类型不是<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#isWildcardType()\">通配符类型</a>，而其他类型是，则此方法返回 <code>false</code>。</li>\n<li>如果两个 MIME 类型的<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#getType()\">类型</a>和<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html#getSubtype()\">子类型</a>相同，则参数最少的 MIME 类型不如其他类型具体。</li>\n<li>否则，此方法返回 <code>false</code>。</li>\n</ol>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>MediaType</code> for the given <a href=\"../util/MimeType.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.util\"><code>MimeType</code></a>.\nThe type, subtype and parameters information is copied and <code>MediaType</code>-specific\nchecks on parameters are performed.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a href=\"../util/MimeType.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.util\"><code>MimeType</code></a>创建一个新的<code>MediaType</code>。\n类型、子类型和参数信息会被复制，并执行针对参数的<code>MediaType</code>特定检查。",
      "count": 2
    },
